Subject: [PATCH 353/443] [ae-patch] Show a green check on the Admin Center
 Needs you badge when nothing needs you

The sidebar badge drew nothing at zero. It now draws a green check when a summary was read and every source answered, and keeps "?" for an unreadable source or a failed route, so a check never covers a broken read.

A sync would conflict in: web/src/lib/aeAttention.ts, web/src/components/AeAttentionBadge.tsx and their tests.
